{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseHostHeader\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseHostHeader</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">config</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config\">Config</a> := <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config.mk\">{</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config.mk\">}</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Internal/Parsec/ByteArray.html#Std.Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser\">Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser</a> (<a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Host\">Host</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Port\">Port</a>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses an HTTP `Host` header value.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseHostHeader","kind":"def","line":478,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseHostHeader","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.lean#L478-L501"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseURIReference\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseURIReference</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">config</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config\">Config</a> := <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config.mk\">{</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config.mk\">}</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Internal/Parsec/ByteArray.html#Std.Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser\">Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URIReference\">URIReference</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses a URI reference as defined in RFC 3986 Section 4.1:\n\n```\nURI-reference = URI / relative-ref\nrelative-ref  = relative-part [ \"?\" query ] [ \"#\" fragment ]\nrelative-part = \"//\" authority path-abempty\n              / path-absolute\n              / path-noscheme\n              / path-empty\n```\n\nA leading `scheme \":\"` commits to a full URI, and a leading `//` to an authority: neither falls back\nto being read as a path when the rest does not parse. Otherwise the reference is an absolute-path\n(`/path`), path-noscheme (`foo/bar`, `../baz`), query-only (`?q`), fragment-only (`#frag`), or empty.\n\nThe fragment is percent-decoded, with bytes that are not valid UTF-8 replaced by U+FFFD.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseURIReference","kind":"def","line":423,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseURIReference","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.lean#L423-L476"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseRequestTarget\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseRequestTarget</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">config</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config\">Config</a> := <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config.mk\">{</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config.mk\">}</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Internal/Parsec/ByteArray.html#Std.Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser\">Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.RequestTarget\">RequestTarget</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses a request target with combined parsing and validation.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseRequestTarget","kind":"def","line":360,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseRequestTarget","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.lean#L360-L421"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseURI\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseURI</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">config</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config\">Config</a> := <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config.mk\">{</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config.mk\">}</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Internal/Parsec/ByteArray.html#Std.Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser\">Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI\">URI</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses a URI (Uniform Resource Identifier).\n\nURI = scheme \":\" hier-part [ \"?\" query ] [ \"#\" fragment ]\nhier-part = \"//\" authority path-abempty / path-absolute / path-rootless / path-empty\n\nThe fragment is percent-decoded, with bytes that are not valid UTF-8 replaced by U+FFFD.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseURI","kind":"def","line":340,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseURI","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.lean#L340-L358"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parsePath\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">parsePath</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">config</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">forceAbsolute </span><span class=\"fn\">allowEmpty</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Internal/Parsec/ByteArray.html#Std.Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser\">Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path\">Path</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses a URI path with combined parsing and validation.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parsePath","kind":"def","line":210,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Parser.parsePath","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.lean#L210-L274"}}],"imports":["Init.Data.String.Basic","Init.Data.String.Search","Init.While","Std.Http.Data.URI.Basic","Std.Http.Data.URI.Config","Std.Internal.Parsec","Std.Internal.Parsec.ByteArray"],"instances":[],"name":"Std.Http.Data.URI.Parser"}